  "metaTitle": "Custom Poly Propylene Bags | Perfect Imprints",
  "metaDescription": "Order custom poly propylene bags for trade shows, retail, or giveaways. Durable, lightweight, and fully customizable at Perfect Imprints.",
  "introHtml": "<p>Poly propylene bags offer a durable, lightweight, and cost-effective alternative to cotton or canvas totes. The non-woven material resists tearing and moisture, making these bags ideal for grocery giveaways, conference swag, or retail packaging. With options like the Y2K Grocery Bag or Abe Tote, you can choose from various sizes and styles. Screen printing or heat transfer decoration ensures your logo stands out on the smooth surface. Perfect for bulk orders where budget and durability matter.</p>",
